.TH mnnn-project-export 1  "mnnn-project-export 2.2.0" 
.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.SH NAME
mnnn\-project\-export \- Export a project: one archive with everything (journals, images, reports, live searches, results and their bars), or a document of it
.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBmnnn project export\fR [\fB\-\-format\fR] [\fB\-\-home\fR] [\fB\-\-db\fR] [\fB\-\-out\fR] [\fB\-\-non\-interactive\fR] [\fB\-\-rows\fR] [\fB\-\-no\-data\fR] [\fB\-v\fR|\fB\-\-verbose\fR]... [\fB\-q\fR|\fB\-\-quiet\fR] [\fB\-y\fR|\fB\-\-yes\fR] [\fB\-\-theme\-mode\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIPROJECT\fR> 
.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.SH DESCRIPTION
Export a project: one archive with everything (journals, images, reports, live searches, results and their bars), or a document of it
.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-format\fR \fI<FORMAT>\fR [default: archive]

.br
\fIPossible values:\fR
.RS 14
.IP \(bu 2
pdf
.IP \(bu 2
html
.IP \(bu 2
docx
.IP \(bu 2
latex
.IP \(bu 2
json
.IP \(bu 2
csv
.IP \(bu 2
text
.IP \(bu 2
archive
.RE
.TP
\fB\-\-home\fR \fI<DIR>\fR
Muninn home directory (default ~/.muninn)
.RS
May also be specified with the \fBMUNINN_HOME\fR environment variable. 
.RE
.TP
\fB\-\-db\fR \fI<PATH>\fR
Database file (default <home>/storage/muninn.database)
.RS
May also be specified with the \fBMUNINN_DB\fR environment variable. 
.RE
.TP
\fB\-\-out\fR \fI<OUT>\fR
Output file (default: <project>.<ext> in the current directory)
.TP
\fB\-\-non\-interactive\fR
Never prompt; missing values are errors
.RS
May also be specified with the \fBMUNINN_NON_INTERACTIVE\fR environment variable. 
.RE
.TP
\fB\-\-rows\fR \fI<ROWS>\fR [default: 20]
Bars listed per result in documents (0: all)
.TP
\fB\-\-no\-data\fR
Leave the bars out of archives and JSON
.TP
\fB\-v\fR, \fB\-\-verbose\fR
More output (repeatable)
.TP
\fB\-q\fR, \fB\-\-quiet\fR
Print nothing but errors and requested data
.RS
May also be specified with the \fBMUNINN_QUIET\fR environment variable. 
.RE
.TP
\fB\-y\fR, \fB\-\-yes\fR
Answer yes to every confirmation
.RS
May also be specified with the \fBMUNINN_YES\fR environment variable. 
.RE
.TP
\fB\-\-theme\-mode\fR \fI<THEME_MODE>\fR
Override the theme mode for this run
.br

.br
\fIPossible values:\fR
.RS 14
.IP \(bu 2
light
.IP \(bu 2
dark
.IP \(bu 2
system
.RE
.RS
May also be specified with the \fBMUNINN_THEME_MODE\fR environment variable. 
.RE
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fIPROJECT\fR>

.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.SH VERSION
v2.2.0
.SH SEE ALSO
\fBmnnn\fR(1)
